OL,3,GNEWSASex attacks on girls in park
OL,4,Ainvestigated
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say they have identified the
OL,7,Fperson in a CCTV image released as part
OL,8,Fof a rape and sexual assault
OL,9,Finvestigation.
OL,11,FThames Valley Police said two
OL,12,F14-year-old girls got into conversation
OL,13,Fwith four males who they did not know
OL,14,Fin Florence Park, Oxford, on 28 July.
OL,16,FThe girls and two males then went to a
OL,17,Fwooded area of Marsh Park, where one
OL,18,Fmale raped one of the girls while the
OL,19,Fother sexually assaulted the second
OL,20,Fgirl, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
